^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,1,0)="SCREENING COMPLETE\\*******************\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,2,0)="This screening tool indicates that the patient has had a fragment removed"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,3,0)="at surgery or has a documented retained fragment. The veteran may benefit"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,4,0)="from specialized medical surveillance for exposure to toxic materials and"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,5,0)="will be added to the VA Embedded Fragment Registry. The VA Toxic Embedded"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,6,0)="Fragment Surveillance Center (TEFSC) will contact the healthcare provider"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,7,0)="or point of contact designated by your VA facility. The TEFSC is located"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,8,0)="at the Baltimore VA Medical Center and can be contacted for additional"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,9,0)="information at 1-800-815-7533. \\"
^PXRMD(801.41,13,25,10,0)="*******************\\"
