^PXRMD(801.41,79,25,4,0)="This is of concern because of the risk of wound contamination and/or "
^PXRMD(801.41,79,25,5,0)="prolonged systemic exposure to potentially toxic metals or chemicals "
^PXRMD(801.41,79,25,6,0)="released from plastics and composite materials found in Improvised "
