^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,3,0)="    * Suggests screening can safely be delayed until 3 years after onset"
^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,4,0)="      of sexual activity or until age 21, whichever comes first"
^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,5,0)="    * Recommends screening at least every 3 years"
^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,6,0)="    * Suggests cervical cancer screening can be stopped after age 65"
^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,7,0)="    * Recommends screening in older women who have not been previously"
^PXRMD(801.41,97,25,8,0)="      screened, when information about previous screening is "
