^PXRMD(801.41,209,25,1,0)="The VHA/DOD Clinical Practice Guideline for Management of Dyslipidemia "
^PXRMD(801.41,209,25,2,0)="recommends that patients with Ischemic Heart Disease have a lipid "
^PXRMD(801.41,209,25,3,0)="profile/LDL every one to two years; and that patients taking lipid "
^PXRMD(801.41,209,25,4,0)="lowering medications have a lipid profile/LDL at least every year."
