^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,0)="^^16^16^3150710"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,1,0)="I'm going to ask about some things that may have happened to you while you"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,2,0)="were in the military. We ask all Veterans these questions because VA"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,3,0)="offers free care related to these experiences. You can choose not to"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,4,0)="answer these questions if you prefer or you may simply say 'yes' or 'no.'"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,5,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,6,0)="1.  When you were in the military, did you ever receive unwanted, "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,7,0)="threatening, or repeated sexual attention (for example, touching, "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,8,0)="cornering, pressure for sexual favors, or inappropriate verbal remarks, "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,9,0)="etc.)?"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,10,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,11,0)="2.  When you were in the military, did you have sexual contact against "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,12,0)="your will or when you were unable to say no (for example, after being "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,13,0)="forced or threatened or to avoid other consequences)?"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,14,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,15,0)="Please check off the appropriate box below based on the Veteran's"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,25,16,0)="responses to the above questions:"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,100)="N"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,110,0)="^801.44D^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,363,110,1,0)="3150710.151212^17"
