^PXRMD(801.41,596,25,1,0)="The VHA recommends women age 50-74 have a mammogram every 2 years.  In "
^PXRMD(801.41,596,25,2,0)="addition, the decision to start regular screening every two years with "
^PXRMD(801.41,596,25,3,0)="mammography for average risk women ages 40-49 should be an individual "
^PXRMD(801.41,596,25,4,0)="decision and take the patient's values into account including values "
^PXRMD(801.41,596,25,5,0)="about specific benefits and harms."
