^PXRMD(801.41,940,0)="VA-TEXT OIF PTSD QUESTIONS^^^E^^^^^^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,940,25,0)="^^16^16^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,940,25,1,0)="A.  Have had any nightmares about it or thought about it when you did "
