^PXRMD(801.41,940,25,7,0)="{FLD:VA*I/A YES/NO}"
^PXRMD(801.41,940,25,8,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,940,25,9,0)="C.  Were constantly on guard, watchful, or easily startled?<br>   "
