^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,0)="^^16^16^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,1,0)="This template is designed to help identify health problems that are"
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,2,0)="uniquely related to military service in Afghanistan and Iraq during"
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,3,0)="recent hazardous combat operations.  The questions target infectious"
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,4,0)="diseases, mental health problems, and chronic symptoms, which may "
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,5,0)="develop in some veterans of Operation Enduring Freedom and Operation "
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,6,0)="Iraqi Freedom."
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,7,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,946,25,8,0)="SEVERAL WEB LINKS HAVE BEEN PROVIDED FOR REFERENCE."
