^PXRMD(801.41,1456,25,2,0)="Purple or maroon localized area of discolored intact skin or blood-filled "
^PXRMD(801.41,1456,25,3,0)="blister due to damage of underlying soft tissue from pressure and/or "
^PXRMD(801.41,1456,25,4,0)="shear. The area may be preceded by tissue that is painful, firm, mushy, "
^PXRMD(801.41,1456,25,5,0)="boggy, warmer or cooler as compared to adjacent tissue. "
^PXRMD(801.41,1456,25,6,0)="\\"
