^PXRMD(801.41,2147,25,4,0)="1) Very good: could hardly have been better\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2147,25,5,0)="2) Pretty good                          \\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2147,25,6,0)="3) Good & bad about equal               \\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2147,25,7,0)="4) Pretty bad                            \\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2147,25,8,0)="5) Very bad: could hardly have been worse \\"
