^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,1,0)="Stage II\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,2,0)="Partial thickness loss of dermis presenting as a shallow open ulcer with "
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,3,0)="a red pink wound bed, without slough. May also present as an intact or "
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,4,0)="open/ruptured serum-filled blister. *This stage should not be used to "
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,5,0)="describe skin tears, tape burns, perineal dermatitis, maceration or "
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,6,0)="excoriation. *Bruising indicates suspected deep tissue injury."
^PXRMD(801.41,2499,25,7,0)="\\"
