^PXRMD(801.41,2500,25,1,0)="Stage III\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,2500,25,2,0)="Full thickness tissue loss. Subcutaneous fat may be visible but bone, "
^PXRMD(801.41,2500,25,3,0)="tendon or muscle are not exposed. Slough may be present but does not "
