^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,0)="^^8^8^3140929"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,1,0)="DEFUSION"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,2,0)="\\The therapeutic process designed to help the Veteran to observe thinking"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,3,0)="as an ongoing behavioral process and to detach from the literal meaning of"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,4,0)="the content of the mind. Through Defusion, the Veteran learns a new and"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,5,0)="less problematic relationship with thinking. This allows personal choice"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,6,0)="guided by values rather than choice guided by the literal problematic"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,7,0)="content of the mind.  Defusion exercises employed in this session"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,25,8,0)="included: CHECK ALL THAT APPLY"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,35,0)="^^1^1^3140929"
^PXRMD(801.41,4229,35,1,0)="Defusion exercises employed in this session include:"
