^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,1,0)="ACCEPTANCE/WILLINGNESS"
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,2,0)="\\The therapeutic processes designed to help the Veteran view"
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,3,0)="Acceptance/Willingness as an alternative to experiential"
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,4,0)="avoidance and misapplied control. These processes involve active "
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,5,0)="awareness and openness to thoughts, emotions, sensations and memories, "
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,6,0)="without unnecessary attempts to change their frequency or form, "
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,7,0)="especially when doing so would lead to psychological rigidity or harm.   "
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,8,0)="Acceptance/Willingness exercises employed in this session included:"
^PXRMD(801.41,4264,25,9,0)="CHECK ALL THAT APPLY. "
