^PXRMD(801.41,7458,0)="VA-CSP INTERIM FOLLOW-UP INTRO TEXT2^^^E^^^^^^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,2)="^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,0)="^^20^20^3151002"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,1,0)="This contact does not require a home visit and may be conducted by "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,2,0)="phone contact, Clinical Video Telehealth (CVT) or Face to Face contact "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,3,0)="at a VHA facility.  The method should be determined in collaboration "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,4,0)="with the Veteran's Treatment Team, the Veteran, and the Caregiver, with "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,5,0)="consideration of the high risk criteria which may indicate the need for "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,6,0)="a home visit. "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,7,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,8,0)="The Interim 90 Day Monitoring Assessment is to be completed by the most "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,9,0)="appropriate discipline/staff as determined by the CSC and/or the "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,10,0)="Veteran's Treatment Team.  It is expected that the staff completing the "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,11,0)="assessment will review the Veteran's chart for hospitalizations, "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,12,0)="emergency visits, outpatient visits, missed appointments, etc., prior to "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,13,0)="the contact. It is also expected that staff will personally interview both"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,14,0)="the Veteran and the Caregiver to complete the Interim 90 Day "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,15,0)="Monitoring Assessment."
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,16,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,17,0)="The outcome of the Interim 90 Day Monitoring Assessment is to be "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,18,0)="communicated with the Veteran's CSC and Treatment Team, which will make "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,19,0)="further determinations on whether or not an Interim In-Home Assessment "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,25,20,0)="visit is to be completed. "
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,100)="N"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,110,0)="^801.44D^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,110,1,0)="3151002.120735^17"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,110,1,1,0)="^^1^1^3151002"
^PXRMD(801.41,7458,110,1,1,1,0)="Exchange Install"
