^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,1,0)="Explore the primary health concerns of the Veteran in the context of "
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,2,0)="exposure to deployment-related airborne hazards/open burn pits. "
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,3,0)="This could include details about the temporal relationship between "
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,4,0)="symptoms and exposures, more details about the actual exposure, more"
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,5,0)="details about the health conditions and symptoms and work up to date, and"
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,6,0)="other contributing factors and comorbidities. Health concerns that are not"
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,7,0)="central to airborne hazards concerns can be addressed in the past medical"
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,8,0)="history (comorbid diagnoses or conditions) or review of systems"
^PXRMD(801.41,8322,25,9,0)="(symptoms)."
