^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,1,0)="Per the Patient Self-Determination Act (PSDA) of 1990 and "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,2,0)="{FLD:VA-ETHICS-LINK-HB-1004-02}, all patients must be given written "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,3,0)="notification stating their right to accept or decline medical treatment, "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,4,0)="to designate a Health Care Agent, and to document their treatment "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,5,0)="preferences in an advance directive. Patients must be informed that VA "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,6,0)="does not discriminate against patients based on whether or not they have "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,7,0)="an advance directive. NOTE: {FLD:VA-ETHICS-FORM 10-0137A} satisfies this "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,8,0)="notification requirement. Consider also providing the patient with "
^PXRMD(801.41,9974,25,9,0)="{FLD:VA-ETHICS-FORM 10-0137B}."
