^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,0)="^^22^22^3150710"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,1,0)="This Veteran has disclosed a previous experience of military sexual "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,2,0)="trauma (MST) and has had an additional period of military service, "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,3,0)="resulting in the opportunity for new experiences of MST and the need for "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,4,0)="additional screening. "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,5,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,6,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,7,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,8,0)="Now I'm going to ask about some things you may have experienced DURING "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,9,0)="YOUR MOST RECENT PERIOD OF MILITARY SERVICE. We ask all Veterans with "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,10,0)="additional military service these questions, so that Veterans can access "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,11,0)="free care related to these experiences. You can decline to answer if you "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,12,0)="prefer, or you may simply say 'yes' or 'no.' \\"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,13,0)="1.  DURING YOUR MOST RECENT PERIOD OF MILITARY SERVICE, did you receive "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,14,0)="unwanted, threatening, or repeated sexual attention (for example, "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,15,0)="touching, cornering, pressure for sexual favors, or inappropriate verbal "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,16,0)="remarks, etc.)?\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,17,0)="2. DURING YOUR MOST RECENT PERIOD OF MILITARY SERVICE, did you have "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,18,0)="sexual contact against your will or when you were unable to say no (for "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,19,0)="example, after being forced or threatened or to avoid other consequences)?"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,20,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,21,0)="Please check off the appropriate box below based on the Veteran's "
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,25,22,0)="responses to the above questions."
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,100)="N"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,110,0)="^801.44D^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,110,1,0)="3150710.15121^17"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,110,1,1,0)="^^1^1^3150710"
^PXRMD(801.41,10819,110,1,1,1,0)="Exchange Install"
