^PXRMD(801.41,13110,25,1,0)="The assessing clinician is not responsible for developing a care plan or "
^PXRMD(801.41,13110,25,2,0)="for management of identified conditions unless an imminent safety risk is "
^PXRMD(801.41,13110,25,3,0)="present.  The assessing clinician is responsible for communicating "
