^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,0)="^^15^15^3151002"
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,1,0)="The Annual Home Visit is to be conducted by a VA clinician."
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,2,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,3,0)="The assessing clinician is not responsible for developing a care plan or "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,4,0)="for the management of identified conditions unless an imminent safety "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,5,0)="risk is present.  The assessing clinician is responsible for "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,6,0)="communicating findings to the Nurse Care Manager or other appropriate "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,7,0)="clinician on the Veteran's Primary Care Team for necessary medical "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,8,0)="follow-up and to the CSC.  The primary intent is to be supportive of the "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,9,0)="Caregiver, and to maximize the likelihood that the Veteran will be cared "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,10,0)="for at home."
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,11,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,12,0)="If the Veteran has a NEW PRIMARY CAREGIVER, the Veteran must complete a "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,13,0)="NEW APPLICATION to the CAREGIVER SUPPORT PROGRAM.  An Initial In-Home "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,14,0)="Assessment is required once the new Caregiver has been approved and "
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,25,15,0)="completed the Caregiver training."
^PXRMD(801.41,13334,100)="N"
