^PXRMD(801.41,14076,25,1,0)="TX  Primary /tumor cannot be assessed\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,14076,25,2,0)="T0  No evidence of primary tumor\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,14076,25,3,0)="T1  Clinically inapparent tumor neither palpable nor visible by imaging\\"
