^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,0)="^^8^8^3160108"
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,1,0)="Education:  The patient understands that\\ "
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,2,0)="1) Images will be placed in the VA computer system to be remotely"
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,3,0)="   viewed by a dermatology provider and that recommendations will "
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,4,0)="   be conveyed to the patient's provider."
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,5,0)="2) Recommendations are based solely on a review of the patient's"
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,6,0)="   submitted history and photographic images."
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,7,0)="3) A conventional, in-person dermatology referral is an option, "
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,25,8,0)="   but may require additional travel and time."
^PXRMD(801.41,14419,35,0)="^^2^2^3160108"
