^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,1,0)="Patients should have sexual orientation documented annually."
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,2,0)="\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,3,0)="\\Example: I am going to ask you about your sexual orientation. We ask "
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,4,0)="all patients about their sexual orientation so that we can recommend "
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,5,0)="preventative care to meet your health goals. You may indicate more than "
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,6,0)="one sexual orientation or choose not to answer. "
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,7,0)="\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,8,0)="\\For more information about the Sexual Orientation mandate, see Directive"
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,9,0)="1340(2) or subsequent policies on VHA Publications: {FLD:VA-DIRECT1340}"
^PXRMD(801.41,50849,25,10,0)="\\"
