^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,0)="VA-TEXT PHQ 9^^^E^^^^^^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,2)="^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,0)="^^37^37^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,1,0)="Ask the patient: Over the past 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,2,0)="by any of the following problems?  "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,3,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,4,0)="Not at all(1)   Several days(2)   More than half the days(3)      "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,5,0)="Nearly every day(4) "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,6,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,7,0)="1.  Little interest or pleasure in doing things<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,8,0)="2.  Feeling down, depressed, or hopeless<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,9,0)="3.  Trouble falling or staying asleep, or sleeping too much<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,10,0)="4.  Feeling tired or having little energy<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,11,0)="5.  Poor appetite or overeating<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,12,0)="6.  Feeling bad about yourself-or that you are a failure or have let "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,13,0)="yourself or your family down<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,14,0)="7.  Trouble concentrating on things, such as reading the newspaper or "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,15,0)="watching television<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,16,0)="8.  Moving or speaking so slowly that other people could have noticed.  "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,17,0)="Or the opposite-being so fidgety or restless that you have been moving "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,18,0)="around a lot more than usual<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,19,0)="9.  Thoughts that you would be better off dead or of hurting yourself in "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,20,0)="some way<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,21,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,22,0)="For questions 1-8, count the number of symptoms that the patient checked "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,23,0)="as ""more than half the days"" or ""nearly every day"" (3 or 4).  "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,24,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,25,0)="For question 9, count the question as positive if the patient checks "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,26,0)="""Several days"", ""More than half the days"" or ""Nearly every day"".  "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,27,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,28,0)="Then, if patient has:<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,29,0)="0-2 PHQ symptoms   - they are not clinically depressed<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,30,0)="3-4 PHQ symptoms   - they have an other depressive syndrome but NOT MDD<br> "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,31,0)="5 or more PHQ symptoms   - suggestive of MDD."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,32,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,33,0)="See DSM-IV criteria for other diagnostic considerations."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,34,0)="<br>"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,35,0)="PRIME-MD is a trademark of Pfizer Inc."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,36,0)="PHQ Copyright 1999 Pfizer Inc. All rights reserved. Reproducted with "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,25,37,0)="permission"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,100)="N"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,110,0)="^801.44D^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,110,1,0)="3050311.122234^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,110,1,1,0)="^^1^1^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,110,1,1,1,0)="Exchange Install"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000164,110,"B",3050311.122234,1)=""
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,0)="VA-GP PHQ 9^^^G^^Y^1^^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,2)="^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,10,0)="^801.412IA^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,10,1,0)="5^598000164"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,10,"B",5,1)=""
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,10,"D",598000164,1)=""
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,10,"TYPE","E",598000164)=""
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,25,0)="^^1^1^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,25,1,0)="Click here to view the PHQ-9 Assessment Tool for Depression"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,100)="N"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,110,0)="^801.44D^1^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,110,1,0)="3050311.122235^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,110,1,1,0)="^^1^1^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,110,1,1,1,0)="Exchange Install"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000165,110,"B",3050311.122235,1)=""
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,0)="VA-TEXT MDD DSM-IV CRITERIA DISPLAY^^^E^^^^^^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,2)="^^1"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,0)="^^54^54^3050311"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,1,0)="Major Depressive Episode (abstracted from DSM-IV, page 327)"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,2,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,3,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,4,0)="a. At least five of the following symptoms have been present during the"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,5,0)="same 2-week period, nearly every day, and represent a change from previous"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,6,0)="functioning. At least one of the symptoms must be either (1) depressed"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,7,0)="mood or (2) loss of interest or pleasure:"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,8,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,9,0)="   (1) depressed mood most of the day, nearly every day, as indicated by"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,10,0)="   self or others."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,11,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,12,0)="   (2) markedly diminished interest or pleasure in all, or almost all,"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,13,0)="   activities."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,14,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,15,0)="   (3) significant weight loss or weight gain (5%/mo.) or loss/gain in"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,16,0)="   appetite nearly every day."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,17,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,18,0)="   (4) insomnia or hypersomnia nearly every day."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,19,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,20,0)="   (5) psychomotor agitation or retardation nearly every day (as noted by"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,21,0)="   others*)."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,22,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,23,0)="   (6) fatigue or loss of energy nearly every day."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,24,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,25,0)="   (7) feelings of worthlessness or excessive or inappropriate guilt"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,26,0)="   nearly every day."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,27,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,28,0)="   (8) diminished ability to think or concentrate or indecisiveness nearly"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,29,0)="   every day."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,30,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,31,0)="   (9) recurrent thoughts of death, recurrent suicidal ideation without a"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,32,0)="   specific plan, or a suicide attempt or a specific plan for committing"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,33,0)="   suicide."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,34,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,35,0)="b. The symptoms caused clinically significant distress or impairment in"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,36,0)="social, occupational, or other important areas of functioning."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,37,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,38,0)="c. Symptoms are not better accounted for by a Mixed Episode, Mood Disorder"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,39,0)="Due to a General Medical Condition, a Substance-Induced Mood Disorder, or"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,40,0)="Bereavement (normal reaction to the death of a loved one)."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,41,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,42,0)="d. Symptoms are not better accounted for by a Psychotic Disorder (e.g.,"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,43,0)="Schizo-affective Disorder)."
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,44,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,45,0)=" "
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,46,0)="NOTE: The criteria for a Major Depressive Episode are set at a fairly high"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,47,0)="threshold. At least five symptoms must occur simultaneously, and the"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,48,0)="symptoms must be present for most of the day, nearly every day, for at"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,49,0)="least 2 weeks. When evaluating a patient for a Major Depressive Episode,"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,50,0)="the symptoms of depressed mood, loss of interest, psychomotor agitation or"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,51,0)="retardation, and diminished ability to concentrate can be indicated by"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,52,0)="either subjective account of the patient or by evidence that the symptoms"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,53,0)="are apparent to others. Contacts with family members may be necessary to"
^PXRMD(801.41,598000166,25,54,0)="make an accurate diagnosis."
