^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,0)="^^10^10^3080203"
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,1,0)="A standardized tool to screen for hazardous or problem drinking should be"
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,2,0)="administered to all patients."
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,3,0)="The AUDIT-C is a sensitive tool for identifying those patients who may be"
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,4,0)="at risk of problems due to drinking."
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,5,0)="The risk of being alcohol dependent and experiencing problems due "
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,6,0)="to drinking increases as AUDIT-C scores increase."
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,7,0)="\\"
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,8,0)="AUDIT-C screening questions should be asked verbatim, in private setting "
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,9,0)="and with a nonjudgmental manner."
^PXRMD(801.41,663000739,25,10,0)="\\"
